}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T19:43:47-07:00","id":1389168,"title":"","content":"I read the series of 5, one about each signature solar exalt back in 1e. They were okay.<br /> <br /> I personally never have terribly high expectations for any novel based on an rpg... They are much more enjoyable that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T19:56:37-07:00","id":1389171,"title":"","content":"The best I've read has been the most recent DB novella, also the anthology had some real hit-or-miss quality. The hits were good though, like the Plentimon story. Are you looking for a good novel to introduce somebody to exalted?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T20:49:28-07:00","id":1389178,"title":"","content":"Nope, just looking for some good Exalted stories to read, and because I can afford to buy a few books to (I hope) send some $ to OPP, hoping they still get a share of it. I have several of the game books and they're fascinating, but I've got nobody to play with (and just don't have time to play either).<br /> <br /> I saw bad reviews of the first anthology for 3E though - people saying the stories were too different from the actual setting material of any edition.<br /> <br /> I'll also say... I'm not enthusiastic to read about the Dynasts trading soul-drained slaves with the Fair Folk, crushing mortal nations, and going on Wyld Hunts against Celestials and &quot;heretics&quot;. I can read about that kind of thing in the daily news. I don't care what kind of Exalted are the protagonists, but I read fantasy for escapism from the horrors of the real world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 05-16-2020, 11:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-16T22:13:45-07:00","id":1389192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389178#post1389178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> send some $ to OPP</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, well there goes my other suggestion which was the Exalted Fanthology then.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389178#post1389178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I saw bad reviews of the first anthology for 3E though - people saying the stories were too different from the actual setting material of any edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Some were actually quite good and most of those were the ones that didn't have weird glaring inconsistencies with the setting. On the other hand there was like, double exalted Dragonblooded/Solar and a first age sorcerous academy in the vein of Hogwarts except every student was a Twilight.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389178#post1389178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll also say... I'm not enthusiastic to read about the Dynasts trading soul-drained slaves with the Fair Folk, crushing mortal nations, and going on Wyld Hunts against Celestials and &quot;heretics&quot;. I can read about that kind of thing in the daily news. I don't care what kind of Exalted are the protagonists, but I read fantasy for escapism from the horrors of the real world.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well you're in luck there because mostly the novels out right now just completely avoid that kind of thing. The two corebook ones take place in Nexus with one of them centering around exigent exaltation and sidereals, and the other around Novia squaring off against mysteries and conspiracies and a Wyld Hunt. The DB novel is about a pair of terrestrials battling forces of death and saving a small town from the predations of an ancient long-sleeping evil and a ruthless organization of exorcists who brook no competition with their trade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T00:25:02-07:00","id":1389212,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s not a novel, but Chancel Aleph has a log of <a href=\"http://nobilis.me/doom-and-gloam\" target=\"_blank\">Doom and Gloam</a>, an Exalted chronicle played by Vance, Elliott Freeman, Rand Brittain, and Jenna Moran.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T08:02:41-07:00","id":1389309,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389178#post1389178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I saw bad reviews of the first anthology for 3E though - people saying the stories were too different from the actual setting material of any edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Most of the content of the anthology is very middle of the road, stories that can be called 'okay' so the online discourse focused on Singular Justice which was a genuine stinker.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T09:14:51-07:00","id":1389331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389171#post1389171\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The best I've read has been the most recent DB novella, also the anthology had some real hit-or-miss quality. The hits were good though, like the Plentimon story.</div> </div> </div> </div>OK! So, the titles of these books are..... ? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Or is this a test of my renown as a secret-finding, data-digging loremaster...?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389192#post1389192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, well there goes my other suggestion which was the Exalted Fanthology then.</div> </div> </div> </div>No I'll read that too! But please give me a url?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389171#post1389171\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some were actually quite good and most of those were the ones that didn't have weird glaring inconsistencies with the setting. On the other hand there was like, double exalted Dragonblooded/Solar and a first age sorcerous academy in the vein of Hogwarts except every student was a Twilight.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389309#post1389309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Most of the content of the anthology is very middle of the road, stories that can be called 'okay' so the online discourse focused on Singular Justice which was a genuine stinker.</div> </div> </div> </div>OK, so then I'll ask, which are great and which are best skipped?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389171#post1389171\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well you're in luck there because mostly the novels out right now just completely avoid that kind of thing. The two corebook ones take place in Nexus with one of them centering around exigent exaltation and sidereals, and the other around Novia squaring off against mysteries and conspiracies and a Wyld Hunt. The DB novel is about a pair of terrestrials battling forces of death and saving a small town from the predations of an ancient long-sleeping evil and a ruthless organization of exorcists who brook no competition with their trade.</div> </div> </div> </div>Great!<br /> Edit: So what are &quot;the two corebook ones&quot; titled?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389212#post1389212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It\u2019s not a novel, but Chancel Aleph has a log of <a href=\"http://nobilis.me/doom-and-gloam\" target=\"_blank\">Doom and Gloam</a>, an Exalted chronicle played by Vance, Elliott Freeman, Rand Brittain, and Jenna Moran.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 05-17-2020, 02:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T09:25:51-07:00","id":1389337,"title":"","content":"Welcome back, by the way. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T10:43:34-07:00","id":1389357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389331#post1389331\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OK! So, the titles of these books are..... ? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Or is this a test of my renown as a secret-finding, data-digging loremaster...?</div> </div> </div> </div>Circle of Protection is the Exigent Sidereal story one<br /> False Images is the Novia Claro one<br /> The Silence of OUr Ancestors is the Dragonblooded one<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389331#post1389331\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No I'll read that too! But please give me a url?</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually can't find the whole compilation, just <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vj6TUfw_SloiZ2VotvUl6cUUn7MOfovDhm7ucwnVqZw/edit\" target=\"_blank\">mine </a>and<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0wdjTo_abl5VEw3MXQ5SWtlRFk/view?pli=1\" target=\"_blank\"> LeTipix's</a> entries.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T17:01:13-07:00","id":1389493,"title":"","content":"I enjoyed Carl Bowen's Exalted novel (he's the guy who wrote a lot of 2e comics, I think.) It's called Pillar of the Sun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T18:22:24-07:00","id":1389513,"title":"","content":"So far I'm planning on buying the Dragon-Blooded and Novia novels.<br /> <br /> Does it work to read Pillar of the Sun (for example) without reading the other 4 books in that set? Has anyone else here read them?<br /> <br /> Circle of Protection... got a bad review on DriveThru that makes the plot out to be nonsensical. I dunno about that.<br /> <br /> <br /> Can anyone tell me which Tales From the Age of Sorrows are good and which to contradict the game lore? Besides the Hogwarts academy and the double-Exalted, I read that there's a story in which Solars are destined from birth, like Sidereals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T19:13:33-07:00","id":1389526,"title":"","content":"I personally liked the Maiden's Kiss. A Resting Place at the Heart of the Mountain was okay, although a bit of an odd reference to Emperor instead of Regent. What You Do Not Understand was pretty interesting, although part off that may be the bold move to tell a story in second person. Herald of Glorious Death was okay too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T20:00:05-07:00","id":1389544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389513#post1389513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So far I'm planning on buying the Dragon-Blooded and Novia novels.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope you enjoy <i>The Silence Of Our Ancestors</i>. It's a novella, so it'll probably just take you an afternoon or two.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Circle of Protection... got a bad review on DriveThru that makes the plot out to be nonsensical. I dunno about that. </div> </div> </div><i>Circle of Protection</i> has a very different tone. Less high fantasy, more YA adventure. It's an extension of the anthology story <i>The Circle Will Be Broken</i>, with help from me to better fit the setting. If you liked the tone of that short story and just wanted it to have an extra shot of <i>Exalted</i>, you might enjoy the novel. If you didn't like the tone, it won't have changed too much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hey, check out my first original RPG, <i>Post-Mortem, </i>here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem</a><br /> <br /> Or read my Exalted novella <i>The Silence of Our Ancestors</i> here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/304805/The-Silence-of-Our-Ancestors-A-DragonBlooded-Novella\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...looded-Novella</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1961-dex-davican","name":"Dex Davican","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-17T22:42:22-07:00","id":1389569,"title":"","content":"I haven't heard of <i>The Circle Will Be Broken...</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span 