ser":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-20T13:03:05-07:00","id":1390362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1389331#post1389331\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OK, so then I'll ask, which are great and which are best skipped?</div> </div> </div> </div>The main ones to skip are A Singular Justice (which in the final version basically warns you it's a waste of time) and When the Moon is Dark (it's competently written but has the infamous Solar Dragon-Blooded) and based on what you said upthread you might find What You Do Not Understand to be a little grimdark.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-20T16:40:36-07:00","id":1390408,"title":"","content":"Thanks Lioness","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-20T21:25:22-07:00","id":1390468,"title":"","content":"Pillar of the Sun, and its series, benefits slightly from sequentiality, in that you get to know the Circle of Solars that it centers in the narrative. But since they're written by different authors, the connections are not deep; perfectly alright to read them out of order. It's not Game of Thrones, with vendettas stretching across books. The drama is book-contained, the characters are not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-21T00:57:58-07:00","id":1390508,"title":"","content":"How\u2019d you like Doom and Gloam? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T15:52:58-07:00","id":1390864,"title":"","content":"I just want to say that I read Silence of Our Ancestors because of this thread and really enjoyed it. Thanks forum!<br /> And Thanks Dex for writing it, I have a DB game coming up and your story really got the creativity flowing!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12778-rustedair","name":"RustedAir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12778_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T16:30:32-07:00","id":1390869,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RustedAir</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1390864#post1390864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just want to say that I read Silence of Our Ancestors because of this thread and really enjoyed it. Thanks forum!<br /> And Thanks Dex for writing it, I have a DB game coming up and your story really got the creativity flowing!</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s awesome, thanks for the feedback. Each time I hear from a fan I have to ask: did you have a favorite character?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Hey, check out my first original RPG, <i>Post-Mortem, </i>here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/307131/PostMortem</a><br /> <br /> Or read my Exalted novella <i>The Silence of Our Ancestors</i> here: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/304805/The-Silence-of-Our-Ancestors-A-DragonBlooded-Novella\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product...looded-Novella</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1961-dex-davican","name":"Dex Davican","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1961_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T21:52:41-07:00","id":1390916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dex Davican</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1389105-recommend-exalted-novels-to-me?p=1390869#post1390869\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That\u2019s awesome, thanks for the feedback. Each time I hear from a fan I have to ask: did you have a favorite character?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's hard to choose, they all were really interesting. But I have to say Nils was a fascinating character, and getting to know and understand him made his choices really have some amazing weight, so I think he narrowly gets the win. Also &quot;Make sure whatever killed me gets killed right back&quot; is a great line, especially given the voice you'd developed for him by that point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12778-rustedair","name":"RustedAir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12778_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-03T13:10:55-07:00","id":1494255,"title":"","content":"This is a necro but the whole forum is dead and needs some reanimatiion. This post is unlikely to bump the thread up anyway because of the errors. I just wanted to give my feedback so far:<br /> <br /> <i>Silence of Our Ancestors</i>: This book is fantastic and amazing and I loved it. I hope we get a sequel! My review is on DriveThruRPG/Storyteller's Vault. Edit: I did not really have a favorite character; maybe Gray. I can relate to being rejected by society just for the way I was born and being unable to commicate clearly with people.<br /> <br /> Anthology: Soooo hit and miss. I liked some stories and hated others. I put my review on DriveThruRPG. Overall a very disappointing book, but some of the stories were good enough to make it worth the $3. I hope The Kingdom of Honey gets a sequel, all it needs to make it totally awesome is some mostly-plausible explanation for the protagonist's weird destiny as a one-off exception (or retcon her to be a Sidereal or reincarnating Chosen of Bees).<br /> <br /> The other suggested stories: I haven't gotten around to reading them yet (I've been reading game material books for a while).<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> In case anyone reads this and manages to post a reply, how good is <i>Sid's Real Life</i> on Storyteller's Vault?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom